   "metric": "capex",
   "statement": "Polycarbonate project commissioning is expected by June 2028.",
   "quote": "So we've clarified earlier, and we are, by and large, remaining kind of in line with that, and we are expecting it to be commissioned by June 2028.",
   "page": 14,
   "horizon": "June 2028",
   "quantitative": true
  },
  {
   "metric": "revenue",
   "statement": "Commercial production of new downstream products is expected from Q3 onwards in FY27.",
   "quote": "Therefore, in FY27, we expect a stronger margin profile, even for the standalone business, compared with FY26. We are also working towards a return to what we consider normalcy a couple of years ago. So FY27 will be this period where you will see an improving trend.",
